ose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>，且在實證應用中，約有三至五個共同因子可有效解釋資產報酬的變異。</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Chamberlain &amp; Rothschild (1983) </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>建立了有限因子模型的理論基礎，證明當資產數量 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>N→∞</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>時，若市場由 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>K </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>個潛在因子驅動，則報酬共變異數矩陣的前 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>K </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>個特徵值會趨於穩定，而其餘特徵值會趨近於零，從而說明可用 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>PCA </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-TW" altLang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>擷取出潛在的共同因子結構。</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="標楷體" panose="03000509000000000000" pitchFamily="65" charset="-120"/><a:cs typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-TW" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" panose="02020603050405020304" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface=